OL,3,GNEWSABalaclava ban could be enforced
OL,4,Athis year - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a ban on balaclavas is
OL,7,Flikely to be introduced across
OL,8,FNottingham city centre by the end of
OL,9,Fthe year.
OL,11,FUnder the proposals, police and
OL,12,Fcommunity protection officers will be
OL,13,Fable to ask people to remove face
OL,14,Fcoverings if they "reasonably believe"
OL,15,Fthey are being used to conceal their
OL,16,Fidentity to commit crime or anti-social
OL,17,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
