OL,3,GNEWSABalaclava ban could be enforced
OL,4,Athis year - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham City Council is yet to
OL,7,Fdecide on the matter, but
OL,8,FNottinghamshire Police Supt Chris
OL,9,FPearson said the force was working hard
OL,10,Fto ensure it had those extra powers.
OL,12,FColin Parr, the council's director for
OL,13,Fcommunities, environment and resident
OL,14,Fservices, said recommendations would be
OL,15,Fdrafted for the city's political
OL,16,Fleaders "in the coming weeks".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
